{"3991390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Kingdom of Soil", "steam_appid": 3991390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>About the Developer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/f803085ad03f8f2ad2844c7f0ac5cc3d.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1560 height=504 /></span>The crowdfunding campaign is now live on <strong>Afdian</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While support is greatly appreciated, it won’t affect the ongoing development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development of <i>A Kingdom of Soil</i> began in May 2025, and the creator is now working full-time on the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community to get the latest updates and behind-the-scenes news:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐦 Dev (X/Twitter): <strong><i><u>@NicoDocci</u></i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Official (X/Twitter):<u><i><strong>@AKingdomofSoil</strong></i></u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 Discord: <u><i><strong></strong></i></u></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A border town in chaos—fields lie barren, beggars collapse on the streets, while bandits and tax collectors alike prey on the weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the ruined tavern, only broken chairs and dust remain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two kingdoms both claim this land, and the winds of war are blowing toward the town. A letter from the village elder arrives: your grandfather’s tavern has been seized. You decide to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《A Kingdom of Soil》</strong> is a pixel-art medieval RPG and management adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c456442ec31603be1eb54134b6a01f31.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c456442ec31603be1eb54134b6a01f31.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c456442ec31603be1eb54134b6a01f31.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a returning heir, rebuilding your family’s legacy amidst turmoil, uncovering buried secrets, and forging your own legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the main story unfolds, you will uncover the mysteries of the tavern and the town, while freely choosing your own way of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b18f6585d38197f6abc9b803a57123d1.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b18f6585d38197f6abc9b803a57123d1.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b18f6585d38197f6abc9b803a57123d1.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/17e4709ce12ce101327f4141b75c4202.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/17e4709ce12ce101327f4141b75c4202.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/17e4709ce12ce101327f4141b75c4202.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow the soil, sow and harvest, fish and hunt… The land is not only your means of survival, but the very foundation of your rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, cook meals, brew ale, craft works of art—every skill can earn you wealth or favors. <br>Deal with all kinds of people using negotiation, intimidation, deception, or charm. Your reputation can open doors—or create enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonds and Companionship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though morals decay and society crumbles, you may still form true bonds with the townsfolk, build a family, and even grow old together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During festivals, the tavern fills with light. Even with war looming, people will still raise their cups and celebrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to thrive in the medieval world?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, steal, and assassinate—plan daring heists in the dark with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One successful strike may make you rich, but it may also turn everyone’s eyes against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a righteous outlaw, or a ruthless brigand? The <strong>choice</strong> is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/1f4abb7f9b5fce4c38969044670066c4.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/1f4abb7f9b5fce4c38969044670066c4.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/1f4abb7f9b5fce4c38969044670066c4.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/412f5cd162ec7e044d221fd6bc4c0951.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/412f5cd162ec7e044d221fd6bc4c0951.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/412f5cd162ec7e044d221fd6bc4c0951.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run Your Own Tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Friend! Have another drink!” Stoke the fire, repair rooms, refresh the menu, hear new stories, take on quests, and hire help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tavern reopens, many will stop by—some bringing wealth and songs, others bringing plots and danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power and Intrigue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the clinking of cups, nobles and politicians will arrive at your tavern.<br>Some truly strive for peace, seeking to prevent war and improve lives.<br>Others are deceitful and greedy, ignoring suffering while clinging to the old order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the table, will you listen and assist, subtly shaping events?<br>Or remain silent, seeking only to endure these troubled times?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Final Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally recover your grandfather’s recipe,<strong> </strong>the <u><i><strong>Legendary Brew</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>returns to the world<strong>.</strong><br>The old tavern once again becomes a beacon in chaos, gathering both hearts and ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the glow of cups and candlelight, there is wealth and song, but also schemes and suspicion.<br>And now, fate rests upon your shoulders:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carry forward the old family name, letting its legacy echo in every cup?<br>Or sever the past entirely, and carve a new epic of your own?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A border town in chaos—fields lie barren, beggars collapse on the streets, while bandits and tax collectors alike prey on the weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the ruined tavern, only broken chairs and dust remain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two kingdoms both claim this land, and the winds of war are blowing toward the town. A letter from the village elder arrives: your grandfather’s tavern has been seized. You decide to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《A Kingdom of Soil》</strong> is a pixel-art medieval RPG and management adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c456442ec31603be1eb54134b6a01f31.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c456442ec31603be1eb54134b6a01f31.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c456442ec31603be1eb54134b6a01f31.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a returning heir, rebuilding your family’s legacy amidst turmoil, uncovering buried secrets, and forging your own legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the main story unfolds, you will uncover the mysteries of the tavern and the town, while freely choosing your own way of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b18f6585d38197f6abc9b803a57123d1.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b18f6585d38197f6abc9b803a57123d1.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b18f6585d38197f6abc9b803a57123d1.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/17e4709ce12ce101327f4141b75c4202.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/17e4709ce12ce101327f4141b75c4202.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><