y also turn everyone’s eyes against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a righteous outlaw, or a ruthless brigand? The <strong>choice</strong> is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/1f4abb7f9b5fce4c38969044670066c4.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/1f4abb7f9b5fce4c38969044670066c4.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/1f4abb7f9b5fce4c38969044670066c4.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/412f5cd162ec7e044d221fd6bc4c0951.poster.avif?t=1787553242\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/412f5cd162ec7e044d221fd6bc4c0951.webm?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/412f5cd162ec7e044d221fd6bc4c0951.mp4?t=1787553242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run Your Own Tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Friend! Have another drink!” Stoke the fire, repair rooms, refresh the menu, hear new stories, take on quests, and hire help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tavern reopens, many will stop by—some bringing wealth and songs, others bringing plots and danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power and Intrigue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the clinking of cups, nobles and politicians will arrive at your tavern.<br>Some truly strive for peace, seeking to prevent war and improve lives.<br>Others are deceitful and greedy, ignoring suffering while clinging to the old order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the table, will you listen and assist, subtly shaping events?<br>Or remain silent, seeking only to endure these troubled times?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Final Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally recover your grandfather’s recipe,<strong> </strong>the <u><i><strong>Legendary Brew</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>returns to the world<strong>.</strong><br>The old tavern once again becomes a beacon in chaos, gathering both hearts and ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the glow of cups and candlelight, there is wealth and song, but also schemes and suspicion.<br>And now, fate rests upon your shoulders:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carry forward the old family name, letting its legacy echo in every cup?<br>Or sever the past entirely, and carve a new epic of your own?</p>", "short_description": "Return to a medieval borderland. Rebuild from a hoe, forge, hunt, and reclaim your tavern amid faction conflicts. Words sway deals, cooking wins hearts, choices shape your legacy. Live your legend in an open world.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/c8fa2b41e63f553ac65c3f3653499d8cbce8448e/header.jpg?t=1787553242", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/5b0ed89fbf52e7b6bbeb81f464f5e49c89448e23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787553242", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/5b0ed89fbf52e7b6bbeb81f464f5e49c89448e23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787553242", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / A